    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Joan Bargeshia's experience at Aga Khan University can be termed as transforming and rewarding. An experience that shaped not only her academic knowledge, but also her personal growth and resilience. During her time at AKU, she has had unique experiences, faced challenges head-on, and nurtured aspirations that go beyond her academic pursuits.",
